  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "A rare opportunity has arrived in Glendowie with Lot 1, 5-7 Calder Place, a beautifully crafted freestanding residence where quality craftsmanship, effortless living, and a coveted coastal setting come together. Thoughtfully designed across two levels, this home has been created with an emphasis on space, light, and everyday functionality. Expansive open-plan living connects seamlessly with private outdoor areas, while premium finishes throughout reflect a commitment to quality and comfort.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the sophisticated kitchen features premium BOSCH appliances and integrated refrigeration, complemented by two beautifully appointed bathrooms and a powder room finished with Italian designer tapware. Additional highlights include bespoke wardrobe systems, generous 2.7m stud heights, and secure internal-access garaging, with every detail carefully considered to enhance modern living. Whether you are seeking a seamless transition into a more manageable lifestyle, a home within a highly regarded school zone, or a premium investment opportunity, Lot 1 offers enduring appeal.\r\n\r\nPositioned to capture a desirable northerly aspect with coastal outlooks and located in a peaceful Glendowie setting close to beaches, parks, and local amenities, this is an exceptional opportunity to secure a brand-new home in a tightly held location.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest today to be among the first to experience Lot 1, 5-7 Calder Place. \r\n\r\nContact Asal on 021 362 356 to arrange a private viewing.\r\n\r\nSome images shown are artist's renderings and may not reflect the final completed property.",
